    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<h1>Feature List</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2632680/extras/8152f13b5ddd1c62befc5cdb27fafb60.avif?t=1749047846\" width=64 height=64 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Where is Pepa?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She barks in the distance, she must be lonely and scared. You just want things to go back to the way they were.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2632680/extras/3c9f846a113384a222d5ff4212562666.poster.avif?t=1749047846\" width=620 height=278 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2632680/extras/3c9f846a113384a222d5ff4212562666.webm?t=1749047846\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Don't touch the Graft</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is something very wrong with that boat following you. Keep your distance at all times.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2632680/extras/48c22899532e5f0046f05b11416ab4b3.poster.avif?t=1749047846\" width=620 height=278 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2632680/extras/48c22899532e5f0046f05b11416ab4b3.webm?t=1749047846\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Navigate on a kayak</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Riding a kayak is like riding a bike, once you learn it you will never forget. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2632680/extras/2a32b56bea21c6c302c52e1f0b0da337.poster.avif?t=1749047846\" width=620 height=278 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2632680/extras/2a32b56bea21c6c302c52e1f0b0da337.webm?t=1749047846\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Realistic physics</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Push, grab, pull. If you don't remember the way, make your own path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2632680/extras/e34a3503ed1aad6884e0d70c680bc7e9.poster.avif?t=1749047846\" width=620 height=278 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2632680/extras/e34a3503ed1aad6884e0d70c680bc7e9.webm?t=1749047846\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Where is Pepa?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She barks in the distance, she must be lonely and scared. You just want things to go back to the way they were.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2632680/extras/3c9f846a113384a222d5ff4212562666.poster.avif?t=1749047846\" width=620 height=278 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2632680/extras/3c9f846a113384a222d5ff4212562666.webm?t=1749047846\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Don't touch the Graft</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is something very wrong with that boat following you. Keep your distance at all times.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2632680/extras/48c22899532e5f0046f05b11416ab4b3.poster.avif?t=1749047846\" width=620 height=278 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2632680/extras/48c22899532e5f0046f05b11416ab4b3.webm?t=1749047846\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Navigate on a kayak</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Riding a kayak is like riding a bike, once you learn it you will never forget. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2632680/extras/2a32b56bea21c6c302c52e1f0b0da337.poster.avif?t=1749047846\" width=620 height=278 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2632680/extras/2a32b56bea21c6c302c52e1f0b0da337.webm?t=1749047846\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Realistic physics</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Push, grab, pull. If you don't remember the way, make your own path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2632680/extras/e34a3503ed1aad6884e0d70c680bc7e9.poster.avif?t=1749047846\" width=620 height=278 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2632680/extras/e34a3503ed1aad6884e0d70c680bc7e9.webm?t=1749047846\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>",
